#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/getting-started/installation.md:12
msgid "Basic install"
msgstr "基本安装"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/getting-started/installation.md:18
msgid ""
"The core install adds `httpx`, `click`, `pydantic`, `pydantic-settings`, "
"`PyYAML`, `cryptography`, `keyring`, `tenacity`, `python-dateutil`, "
"`requests`, `anyio`, `numpy` and `tqdm`. It provides search, authenticated "
"download, caching and the command-line interface. Processing features are "
"optional extras, so a basic install stays light. A virtual environment is "
"recommended:"
msgstr ""
"核心安装会添加 `httpx`、`click`、`pydantic`、`pydantic-"
"settings`、`PyYAML`、`cryptography`、`keyring`、`tenacity`、`python-"
"dateutil`、`requests`、`anyio`、`numpy` 和 `tqdm`。它提供搜索、需认证的下载、缓存和命令行界面。处理功能属于可选"
" extra，因此基本安装保持轻量。建议使用虚拟环境："

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/getting-started/installation.md:31
msgid ""
"The command-line interface imports `rich`, and optical validation imports "
"`shapely`. Neither is declared in the `pyproject.toml` core dependencies "
"(the conda recipe in `meta.yaml` does list `rich`, so a conda install is "
"unaffected). If `pygeofetch --help` fails with `ModuleNotFoundError: No "
"module named 'rich'`, or an import of `shapely` fails, run `pip install rich"
" shapely`, or use the `geo` extra, which includes `shapely`. See [Known "
"issues](../reference/known-issues.md#undeclared-dependencies)."
msgstr ""
"命令行界面会导入 `rich`，光学验证会导入 `shapely`。两者都未在 `pyproject.toml` "
"的核心依赖项中声明（`meta.yaml` 中的 conda 配方确实列出了 `rich`，因此 conda 安装不受影响）。如果 "
"`pygeofetch --help` 失败并报 `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'rich'`，或者导入 "
"`shapely` 失败，请运行 `pip install rich shapely`，或使用包含 `shapely` 的 `geo` "
"extra。参见[已知问题](../reference/known-issues.md#undeclared-dependencies)。"

